{"id":71184,"date":"2026-10-28T09:21:45","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:21:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71184"},"modified":"2026-10-28T10:24:51","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:24:51","slug":"grande-premio-de-atletismo-de-sao-martinho","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-de-atletismo-de-sao-martinho\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026<\/strong> (oficialmente <strong>XVI Grande Pr\u00e9mio S. Martinho \/ ACT<\/strong>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Travanca<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Integrada no circuito de provas de atletismo de Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o abre \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> com os escal\u00f5es jovens e tem a partida da corrida principal marcada para as <strong>11h05<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo contempla seis partidas para os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 <strong>Infantis F\/M (1.300 m)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h30 e 09h45, <strong>Iniciados e Juvenis F\/M (2.500 m)<\/strong> \u00e0s 10h00 e 10h20, e <strong>Benjamins A e B F\/M (500 m)<\/strong> \u00e0s 10h40 e 10h50 \u2014 culminando \u00e0s <strong>11h05<\/strong> na <strong>Prova Principal de 7.500 metros (7,5 km)<\/strong> destinada a Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos (M\/F).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural de Travanca (ACT)<\/strong>, com ajuizamento e delega\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica do Conselho de Arbitragem da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro<\/strong>. A prova atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios, medalhas individuais, trof\u00e9us coletivos para as 3 primeiras equipas (classifica\u00e7\u00e3o Jovem e Principal) e lembran\u00e7as com t-shirt para todos os participantes.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box