ase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Infantis Femininos \/ Masculinos (1.300 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 de novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Femininos \u00e0s 09h30 | Masculinos \u00e0s 09h45 (nascidos 2013\/2014):<\/strong> Gratuita<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Benjamins A e B Femininos \/ Masculinos (500 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 de novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:40<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Femininos \u00e0s 10h40 | Masculinos \u00e0s 10h50 (nascidos 2015 e posteriores):<\/strong> Gratuita<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 16\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de S\u00e3o Martinho (XVI Grande Pr\u00e9mio S. Martinho \/ ACT) realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, em Travanca, concelho de Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is (distrito de Aveiro), com in\u00edcio das provas jovens \u00e0s 09h30 e partida da prova principal de 7,5 km \u00e0s 11h05.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o programa completo de hor\u00e1rios e dist\u00e2ncias por escal\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa oficial \u00e9 o seguinte: 09h30 \u2013 Infantis Femininos (1.300 m); 09h45 \u2013 Infantis Masculinos (1.300 m); 10h00 \u2013 Iniciados e Juvenis Femininos (2.500 m); 10h20 \u2013 Iniciados e Juvenis Masculinos (2.500 m); 10h40 \u2013 Benjamins A e B Femininos (500 m); 10h50 \u2013 Benjamins A e B Masculinos (500 m); e 11h05 \u2013 Corrida Principal de 7.500 m (Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos M\/F).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e a data limite de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23h59 do dia 12 de novembro de 2026. A participa\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 gratuita para todos os escal\u00f5es jovens (Benjamins a Juvenis). Na prova principal de 7.500 m, o valor de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 de 5,00 \u20ac para atletas federados e de 7,50 \u20ac para atletas n\u00e3o federados.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o levantamento de dorsais e a entrega do chip?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais e respetivos chips de cronometragem s\u00e3o entregues no secretariado da prova at\u00e9 meia hora antes do in\u00edcio de cada corrida, devendo os atletas apresentar-se na linha de partida 15 minutos antes do tiro de sa\u00edda. O chip \u00e9 de devolu\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria no final da prova (a n\u00e3o devolu\u00e7\u00e3o implica o pagamento de 5,00 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que pr\u00e9mios e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es coletivas existem na prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">S\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios, medalhas individuais e lembran\u00e7as (incluindo t-shirt) a todos os participantes. Coletivamente, s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us \u00e0s 3 primeiras equipas da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o Jovem (Benjamins a Juvenis) e da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o Principal (Juniores a Veteranos), pontuando os atletas classificados nos 12 primeiros lugares de cada escal\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza e aju\u00edza o Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de S\u00e3o Martinho?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural de Travanca (ACT), integrado no circuito de provas de Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is, com arbitragem e delega\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Travanca, Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026 realiza-se a 15 de novembro em Travanca, Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is. Prova de 7,5 km e jovens. Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-grande-premio-de-atletismo-de-sao-martinho.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida Principal \u2013 Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos (7.500 m)\", \"price\": \"5.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/gp-atletismo-sao-martinho-travanca-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Iniciados e Juvenis Femininos \/ Masculinos (2.500 m)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/gp-atletismo-sao-martinho-travanca-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Infantis Femininos \/ Masculinos (1.300 m)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/gp-atletismo-sao-martinho-travanca-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Benjamins A e B Femininos \/ Masculinos (500 m)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/gp-atletismo-sao-martinho-travanca-2026\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural de Travanca\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\":